<title>USA: Hello Direct names Nystrom as CFO.</title>
<headline>Hello Direct names Nystrom as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hello Direct Inc said it had appointed Raymond Nystrom as vice president of operations and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>It said Nystrom would assumes the position from Norman Bunas, who left the company on October 31 to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>It said Nystrom served as the vice president of finance, chief financial officer and general manager of North American operations of Inmac Corp, a direct marketer of computer hardware and software products.</p>
<p>Hello Direct is a leading direct marketer and developer of innovative telecommunications products to business end-users.</p>
</text>
